---
---
<section class="quality-metrics">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="metrics-wrapper glass reveal">
      <div class="metrics-content">
        <span class="badge-quality">GOOGLE LIGHTHOUSE</span>
        <h2>No solo hacemos que se vea bien, <br/> <span class="gradient-text">hacemos que vuele.</span></h2>
        <p>Optimizamos cada línea de código para garantizar que tu sitio cargue instantáneamente, mejorando el SEO y la retención de usuarios.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="scores-grid">
        <div class="score-item">
          <div class="score-circle perf">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="circular-chart">
              <path class="circle-bg" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
              <path class="circle" stroke-dasharray="100, 100" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="score-number">100</span>
          </div>
          <span class="score-label">Rendimiento</span>
        </div>

        <div class="score-item">
          <div class="score-circle access">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="circular-chart">
              <path class="circle-bg" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
              <path class="circle" stroke-dasharray="100, 100" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="score-number">100</span>
          </div>
          <span class="score-label">Accesibilidad</span>
        </div>

        <div class="score-item">
          <div class="score-circle seo">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="circular-chart">
              <path class="circle-bg" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
              <path class="circle" stroke-dasharray="100, 100" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="score-number">100</span>
          </div>
          <span class="score-label">SEO</span>
        </div>

        <div class="score-item">
          <div class="score-circle best">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="circular-chart">
              <path class="circle-bg" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
              <path class="circle" stroke-dasharray="100, 100" d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="score-number">100</span>
          </div>
          <span class="score-label">Prácticas</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quality-metrics {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .metrics-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    padding: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-radius: 40px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
  }

  .badge-quality {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
    color: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
  }

  .metrics-content h2 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: white;
  }

  .metrics-content p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .scores-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .score-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .score-circle {
    position: relative;
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .circular-chart {
    display: block;
    margin: 10px auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 250px;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .circle-bg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    stroke-width: 2.8;
  }

  .circle {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke: #22c55e;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.6));
    animation: progress 2s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .score-number {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #22c55e;
  }

  .score-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .metrics-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .scores-grid {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .metrics-content h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .scores-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .score-circle {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
    }
  }
</style>
